const normText=s=>String(s||'').normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'').toLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim();
let libraryTarget=null, librarySearch='', libraryGroup='', librarySubgroup='', libraryFavoritesOnly=false;
function ensureLibrary(){if(!Array.isArray(state.library))state.library=[];if(!Array.isArray(state.libraryGroups))state.libraryGroups=[];if(!state.library.length&&window.GYMCATALOG?.length)state.library=window.GYMCATALOG.map(e=>({...e}));}
function libraryGroups(){ensureLibrary();return [...new Set([...state.library.map(e=>e.group),...state.libraryGroups.map(g=>g.name)])].filter(Boolean).sort((a,b)=>a.localeCompare(b,'es'));}
function librarySubgroups(group){ensureLibrary();return [...new Set(state.library.filter(e=>!group||e.group===group).map(e=>e.subgroup).concat(state.libraryGroups.filter(g=>!group||g.group===group).map(g=>g.subgroup||'')))].filter(Boolean).sort((a,b)=>a.localeCompare(b,'es'));}
function libraryView(){ensureLibrary();const groups=libraryGroups();const list=state.library.filter(e=>(!libraryGroup||e.group===libraryGroup)&&(!librarySubgroup||e.subgroup===librarySubgroup)&&(!libraryFavoritesOnly||e.favorite)&&(!librarySearch||normText([e.name,e.group,e.subgroup,e.equipment,(e.secondary||[]).join(' ')].join(' ')).includes(normText(librarySearch))));return `<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:0"><div><h2>Biblioteca de ejercicios</h2><p class="muted small">${state.library.length} ejercicios · catálogo editable y guardado en este dispositivo</p></div><button class="btn primary" data-action="lib-new">＋ Crear ejercicio</button></div><div class="card"><div class="field"><label for="lib-search">Buscar por nombre, grupo o equipamiento</label><input id="lib-search" value="${esc(librarySearch)}" placeholder="Ej. press inclinado, polea, dorsal…"></div><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="lib-group">Grupo muscular</label><select id="lib-group"><option value="">Todos los grupos</option>${groups.map(g=>`<option ${g===libraryGroup?'selected':''}>${esc(g)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label for="lib-subgroup">Subgrupo muscular</label><select id="lib-subgroup"><option value="">Todos los subgrupos</option>${librarySubgroups(libraryGroup).map(g=>`<option ${g===librarySubgroup?'selected':''}>${esc(g)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="btn ${libraryFavoritesOnly?'primary':'soft'}" data-action="lib-favorites">★ ${libraryFavoritesOnly?'Ver todos':'Solo favoritos'}</button><button class="btn" data-action="lib-clear-filters">Limpiar filtros</button><button class="btn" data-action="lib-manage-groups">Gestionar grupos y subgrupos</button></div></div><p class="muted small">Mostrando ${list.length} ejercicios. Los cambios en la biblioteca no reescriben los ejercicios ya guardados en las rutinas ni las sesiones históricas.</p><div class="library-list">${list.slice(0,250).map(e=>`<article class="card library-item"><div class="library-thumb">${e.photo?`<img src="${e.photo}" alt="${esc(e.name)}">`:'🏋️'}</div><div class="library-item-main"><div class="row between"><b>${esc(e.name)}</b><span class="pill">${e.isDefault?'Predeterminado':'Personalizado'}</span></div><p class="muted small">${esc(e.group)} · ${esc(e.subgroup)}</p><p class="muted small">${esc(e.equipment||'Equipamiento no especificado')}${e.secondary?.length?' · Secundarios: '+esc(e.secondary.join(', ')):''}</p>${e.description?`<p>${esc(e.description)}</p>`:''}<div class="actions"><button class="btn primary small-btn" data-action="lib-use" data-id="${e.id}">Añadir a rutina</button><button class="btn small-btn" data-action="lib-favorite" data-id="${e.id}">${e.favorite?'★ Favorito':'☆ Favorito'}</button><button class="btn small-btn" data-action="lib-edit" data-id="${e.id}">Editar</button>${!e.isDefault?`<button class="btn danger small-btn" data-action="lib-delete" data-id="${e.id}">Eliminar</button>`:''}<button class="btn small-btn" data-action="lib-where" data-id="${e.id}">Ver rutinas</button></div></div></article>`).join('')||'<div class="card empty">No hay ejercicios con estos filtros. Prueba otra búsqueda o crea un ejercicio.</div>'}${list.length>250?'<p class="muted">Se muestran los primeros 250 resultados. Afina la búsqueda para ver otros ejercicios.</p>':''}</div>`}
function libEquipmentOptions(selected=''){return ['','Máquina','Polea','Barra','Mancuernas','Multipower','Peso corporal','Bandas elásticas','Kettlebell','Banco','TRX','Máquina cardiovascular','Otros'].map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x)}" ${x===selected?'selected':''}>${x||'Sin especificar'}</option>`).join('')}
function libForm(id=''){ensureLibrary();const e=state.library.find(x=>x.id===id)||{};const groups=libraryGroups();const subgroups=librarySubgroups(e.group||libraryGroup);modal(`<h2>${id?'Editar ejercicio':'Crear ejercicio nuevo'}</h2><form id="library-form" data-id="${esc(id)}"><div class="field"><label>Nombre del ejercicio *</label><input name="name" required maxlength="120" value="${esc(e.name||'')}"></div><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Grupo muscular *</label><input name="group" list="lib-groups-list" required value="${esc(e.group||libraryGroup||'')}"><datalist id="lib-groups-list">${groups.map(g=>`<option value="${esc(g)}">`).join('')}</datalist></div><div class="field"><label>Subgrupo muscular *</label><input name="subgroup" list="lib-subgroups-list" required value="${esc(e.subgroup||librarySubgroup||'')}"><datalist id="lib-subgroups-list">${subgroups.map(g=>`<option value="${esc(g)}">`).join('')}</datalist><small class="muted">Puedes escribir un subgrupo nuevo.</small></div><div class="field"><label>Equipamiento</label><select name="equipment">${libEquipmentOptions(e.equipment||'')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Músculos secundarios</label><input name="secondary" value="${esc((e.secondary||[]).join(', '))}" placeholder="Ej. tríceps, deltoide anterior"></div></div><div class="field"><label>Descripción o instrucciones</label><textarea name="description" rows="3">${esc(e.description||'')}</textarea></div><div class="field"><label>Notas</label><textarea name="notes" rows="2">${esc(e.notes||'')}</textarea></div><div class="field"><label>Fotografía del ejercicio o máquina</label><input type="file" id="lib-photo" accept="image/*"><div id="lib-photo-preview" class="library-thumb">${e.photo?`<img src="${e.photo}" alt="Vista previa">`:'Sin fotografía'}</div><button type="button" class="btn small-btn" data-action="lib-clear-photo">Quitar fotografía</button></div><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="btn" data-action="close-modal">Cancelar</button><button class="btn primary">Guardar ejercicio</button></div></form>`);const form=$('#library-form');form.dataset.photo=e.photo||'';$('#lib-photo').onchange=async ev=>{const file=ev.target.files?.[0];if(!file)return;if(!file.type.startsWith('image/'))return toast('Selecciona una imagen.');if(file.size>8*1024*1024)return toast('La fotografía debe ocupar menos de 8 MB.');const data=await new Promise((res,rej)=>{const r=new FileReader();r.onload=()=>res(r.result);r.onerror=rej;r.readAsDataURL(file)});form.dataset.photo=data;$('#lib-photo-preview').innerHTML=`<img src="${data}" alt="Vista previa">`}}
function libChooseTarget(type){if(type==='session'){libraryTarget={type:'session',dayIndex:sessionDayIndex};return}if(editRoutineId&&editDayId){libraryTarget={type:'routine',rid:editRoutineId,did:editDayId};return}const r=activeRoutine();libraryTarget={type:'routine',rid:r?.id,did:r?.days?.[0]?.id};}
function libPicker(){ensureLibrary();librarySearch='';libraryGroup='';librarySubgroup='';libraryFavoritesOnly=false;modal(`<h2>Añadir ejercicio</h2><p>Elige un ejercicio de la biblioteca o crea uno nuevo. La configuración de la rutina se guarda por separado.</p><div class="actions"><button class="btn primary" data-action="lib-picker-existing">Elegir ejercicio existente</button><button class="btn" data-action="lib-picker-create">＋ Crear ejercicio nuevo</button></div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" data-action="close-modal">Cancelar</button></div>`)}
function libPickerExisting(){const groups=libraryGroups();const filtered=state.library.filter(e=>(!libraryGroup||e.group===libraryGroup)&&(!librarySubgroup||e.subgroup===librarySubgroup)&&(!libraryFavoritesOnly||e.favorite)&&(!librarySearch||normText([e.name,e.group,e.subgroup,e.equipment].join(' ')).includes(normText(librarySearch))));modal(`<h2>Elegir ejercicio existente</h2><div class="field"><label>Buscar</label><input id="pick-search" placeholder="Busca por nombre, incluso sin acentos" value="${esc(librarySearch)}"></div><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Grupo muscular</label><select id="pick-group"><option value="">Todos</option>${groups.map(g=>`<option ${g===libraryGroup?'selected':''}>${esc(g)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Subgrupo</label><select id="pick-subgroup"><option value="">Todos</option>${librarySubgroups(libraryGroup).map(g=>`<option ${g===librarySubgroup?'selected':''}>${esc(g)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="btn" data-action="lib-pick-favs">☆ Favoritos</button><button class="btn" data-action="lib-picker-create">＋ Crear ejercicio nuevo</button></div><div id="pick-results" class="library-list">${filtered.slice(0,120).map(e=>`<article class="card library-item"><div class="library-thumb">${e.photo?`<img src="${e.photo}" alt="">`:'🏋️'}</div><div class="library-item-main"><b>${esc(e.name)}</b><p class="muted small">${esc(e.group)} · ${esc(e.subgroup)} · ${esc(e.equipment||'Sin equipamiento')}</p><button class="btn primary small-btn" data-action="lib-select-exercise" data-id="${e.id}">Seleccionar</button></div></article>`).join('')||'<p class="muted">No hay coincidencias.</p>'}</div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" data-action="close-modal">Cancelar</button></div>`);const update=()=>{librarySearch=$('#pick-search')?.value||'';libraryGroup=$('#pick-group')?.value||'';librarySubgroup=$('#pick-subgroup')?.value||'';const results=state.library.filter(e=>(!libraryGroup||e.group===libraryGroup)&&(!librarySubgroup||e.subgroup===librarySubgroup)&&(!libraryFavoritesOnly||e.favorite)&&(!librarySearch||normText([e.name,e.group,e.subgroup,e.equipment].join(' ')).includes(normText(librarySearch))));$('#pick-results').innerHTML=results.slice(0,120).map(e=>`<article class="card library-item"><div class="library-thumb">${e.photo?`<img src="${e.photo}" alt="">`:'🏋️'}</div><div class="library-item-main"><b>${esc(e.name)}</b><p class="muted small">${esc(e.group)} · ${esc(e.subgroup)} · ${esc(e.equipment||'Sin equipamiento')}</p><button class="btn primary small-btn" data-action="lib-select-exercise" data-id="${e.id}">Seleccionar</button></div></article>`).join('')||'<p class="muted">No hay coincidencias.</p>'};$('#pick-search').oninput=update;$('#pick-group').onchange=()=>{librarySubgroup='';$('#pick-subgroup').innerHTML='<option value="">Todos</option>'+librarySubgroups($('#pick-group').value).map(g=>`<option>${esc(g)}</option>`).join('');update()};$('#pick-subgroup').onchange=update;}
function libConfigureAndAdd(e){if(!e)return;modal(`<h2>Configurar ejercicio</h2><p><b>${esc(e.name)}</b> · ${esc(e.group)} / ${esc(e.subgroup)}</p><form id="lib-config-form" data-id="${e.id}"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Series</label><input name="sets" type="number" min="1" max="50" value="3" required></div><div class="field"><label>Tipo de objetivo</label><select name="unit"><option value="repeticiones">Repeticiones</option><option value="segundos">Duración (segundos)</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Mínimo / duración</label><input name="min" type="number" min="1" value="8" required></div><div class="field"><label>Máximo</label><input name="max" type="number" min="1" value="12" required></div><div class="field"><label>Descanso (segundos)</label><input name="rest" type="number" min="0" value="90" required></div><div class="field"><label>Variante / máquina concreta</label><input name="variant" placeholder="Ej. Hammer, agarre neutro" value="${esc(e.equipment||'')}"></div></div><div class="field"><label>Notas personales</label><textarea name="notes" rows="2" placeholder="Ajustes del asiento, agarre…"></textarea></div><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="btn" data-action="close-modal">Cancelar</button><button class="btn primary">Añadir a la rutina</button></div></form>`)}
function libAddToTarget(e,config={}){if(!e)return;const sets=Number(config.sets)||3,min=Number(config.min)||8,max=Number(config.max)||12;const item={id:uid(),libraryId:e.id,name:e.name,muscle:e.group,muscleGroup:e.group,subgroup:e.subgroup,machine:config.variant||e.equipment||'',photo:e.photo||null,sets,min,max,rest:Number(config.rest??90),unit:config.unit||'repeticiones',notes:config.notes||'',variant:config.variant||'',secondary:[...(e.secondary||[])],setsData:[]};if(libraryTarget?.type==='session'&&state.workout){const d=state.workout.days[libraryTarget.dayIndex]||state.workout.days[0];if(!d)return toast('No se ha encontrado el día de entrenamiento.');item.setsData=Array.from({length:3},()=>({weight:'',reps:'',done:false}));d.exercises.push(item);save();closeModal();currentView='entrenamiento';render();toast('Ejercicio añadido al entrenamiento.');return}const r=state.routines.find(x=>x.id===libraryTarget?.rid)||activeRoutine();const d=r?.days.find(x=>x.id===libraryTarget?.did)||r?.days?.[0];if(!d)return toast('Selecciona primero una rutina.');d.exercises.push(item);save();closeModal();if(currentView==='biblioteca')render();else if(editRoutineId&&editDayId){const rr=state.routines.find(x=>x.id===editRoutineId),dd=rr?.days.find(x=>x.id===editDayId);if(rr&&dd&&typeof dayExercisesEditor==='function')dayExercisesEditor(rr,dd);else render()}else render();toast('Ejercicio añadido a la rutina.');}
function libManageGroups(){const groups=libraryGroups();modal(`<h2>Gestionar grupos y subgrupos</h2><p class="muted small">Escribe un nombre nuevo o uno existente para evitar duplicados.</p><form id="lib-group-form"><div class="field"><label>Grupo muscular</label><input name="group" list="manage-groups" required><datalist id="manage-groups">${groups.map(g=>`<option value="${esc(g)}">`).join('')}</datalist></div><div class="field"><label>Subgrupo (opcional)</label><input name="subgroup" list="manage-subs"><datalist id="manage-subs">${librarySubgroups('').map(g=>`<option value="${esc(g)}">`).join('')}</datalist></div><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="btn" data-action="close-modal">Cancelar</button><button class="btn primary">Crear grupo/subgrupo</button></div></form><hr><div>${groups.map(g=>`<p><b>${esc(g)}</b> <span class="muted small">${librarySubgroups(g).length} subgrupos</span></p>`).join('')}</div>`)}
function libWhere(id){const e=state.library.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!e)return;const found=[];state.routines.forEach(r=>r.days.forEach(d=>d.exercises.forEach(x=>{if(x.libraryId===id||normText(x.name)===normText(e.name))found.push(`${r.name} — ${d.name}`)})));modal(`<h2>Uso de «${esc(e.name)}»</h2>${found.length?`<ul>${found.map(x=>`<li>${esc(x)}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`:'<p>Este ejercicio no aparece en las rutinas guardadas.</p>'}<div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" data-action="close-modal">Cerrar</button></div>`)}
function libDelete(id){const e=state.library.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!e)return;if(!confirm(`¿Eliminar «${e.name}» de la biblioteca? Las rutinas y sesiones ya guardadas conservarán su copia. Puedes recuperar los ejercicios predeterminados con «Restaurar catálogo».`))return;state.library=state.library.filter(x=>x.id!==id);save();render();toast('Ejercicio eliminado de la biblioteca; el historial no se ha modificado.')}
function libRestore(){if(!confirm('Se restaurarán los ejercicios predeterminados que falten. Los ejercicios personalizados y los ya existentes se conservarán.'))return;const seen=new Set(state.library.map(e=>normText(e.name)+'|'+normText(e.group)+'|'+normText(e.subgroup)));(window.GYMCATALOG||[]).forEach(e=>{const key=normText(e.name)+'|'+normText(e.group)+'|'+normText(e.subgroup);if(!seen.has(key))state.library.push({...e,id:uid()})});save();render();toast('Catálogo predeterminado restaurado.')}
// Capture navigation and library actions before the legacy action handler.
document.addEventListener('click',async ev=>{const navBtn=ev.target.closest('[data-view="biblioteca"]');if(navBtn){ev.preventDefault();ev.stopImmediatePropagation();if(state.workout&&!confirm('Hay un entrenamiento en curso. ¿Quieres salir de esta pantalla? Los datos registrados se guardan automáticamente.'))return;ensureLibrary();currentView='biblioteca';render();return}const b=ev.target.closest('[data-action]');if(!b)return;const a=b.dataset.action,id=b.dataset.id;if(['new-exercise','add-to-session','lib-new','lib-edit','lib-use','lib-favorite','lib-delete','lib-where','lib-clear-filters','lib-favorites','lib-manage-groups','lib-picker-existing','lib-picker-create','lib-select-exercise','lib-pick-favs','lib-clear-photo'].includes(a)){ev.preventDefault();ev.stopImmediatePropagation();ensureLibrary();if(a==='new-exercise'||a==='add-to-session'){libChooseTarget(a==='add-to-session'?'session':'routine');libPicker()}else if(a==='lib-new'){libraryTarget=null;libForm();}else if(a==='lib-edit')libForm(id);else if(a==='lib-use'){libChooseTarget('routine');libConfigureAndAdd(state.library.find(e=>e.id===id))}else if(a==='lib-favorite'){const e=state.library.find(e=>e.id===id);if(e)e.favorite=!e.favorite;await save();render()}else if(a==='lib-delete')libDelete(id);else if(a==='lib-where')libWhere(id);else if(a==='lib-clear-filters'){librarySearch='';libraryGroup='';librarySubgroup='';libraryFavoritesOnly=false;render()}else if(a==='lib-favorites'){libraryFavoritesOnly=!libraryFavoritesOnly;render()}else if(a==='lib-manage-groups')libManageGroups();else if(a==='lib-picker-existing')libPickerExisting();else if(a==='lib-picker-create')libForm();else if(a==='lib-select-exercise'){const e=state.library.find(x=>x.id===id);if(e)libConfigureAndAdd(e)}else if(a==='lib-pick-favs'){libraryFavoritesOnly=!libraryFavoritesOnly;libPickerExisting()}else if(a==='lib-clear-photo'){const f=$('#library-form');if(f){f.dataset.photo='';$('#lib-photo-preview').textContent='Sin fotografía'}}return}},true);
document.addEventListener('input',ev=>{if(ev.target.id==='lib-search'){librarySearch=ev.target.value;const pos=ev.target.selectionStart;render();const input=$('#lib-search');input?.focus();input?.setSelectionRange(pos,pos)}},true);
document.addEventListener('change',ev=>{if(ev.target.id==='lib-group'){libraryGroup=ev.target.value;librarySubgroup='';render()}else if(ev.target.id==='lib-subgroup'){librarySubgroup=ev.target.value;render()}},true);
document.addEventListener('submit',async ev=>{const f=ev.target;if(f.id==='lib-config-form'){ev.preventDefault();ev.stopImmediatePropagation();const d=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f));const e=state.library.find(x=>x.id===f.dataset.id);if(!e)return toast('No se encuentra el ejercicio seleccionado.');if(Number(d.sets)<1||Number(d.sets)>50||Number(d.min)<1||Number(d.max)<Number(d.min)||Number(d.rest)<0)return toast('Revisa series, repeticiones y descanso.');libAddToTarget(e,d);return}if(f.id==='library-form'){ev.preventDefault();ev.stopImmediatePropagation();const d=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f));const name=d.name.trim(),group=d.group.trim(),subgroup=d.subgroup.trim();if(!name||!group||!subgroup)return toast('Nombre, grupo y subgrupo son obligatorios.');const key=normText(name)+'|'+normText(group)+'|'+normText(subgroup),existing=state.library.find(x=>normText(x.name)+'|'+normText(x.group)+'|'+normText(x.subgroup)===key&&x.id!==f.dataset.id);if(existing&&!confirm(`Ya existe «${existing.name}» en ese grupo y subgrupo. ¿Quieres editar el ejercicio existente en lugar de crear un duplicado?`))return;if(existing){closeModal();libForm(existing.id);return}const old=state.library.find(x=>x.id===f.dataset.id);const e={...(old||{}),id:old?.id||uid(),name,group,subgroup,equipment:d.equipment||'',secondary:d.secondary.split(',').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean),description:d.description.trim(),notes:d.notes.trim(),photo:f.dataset.photo||null,favorite:old?.favorite||false,isDefault:old?.isDefault||false};if(!state.library.some(x=>x.id===e.id))state.library.push(e);else state.library=state.library.map(x=>x.id===e.id?e:x);if(!state.libraryGroups.some(g=>normText(g.name)===normText(group)))state.libraryGroups.push({name:group});if(!state.libraryGroups.some(g=>normText(g.name)===normText(group)&&normText(g.subgroup)===normText(subgroup)))state.libraryGroups.push({name:group,subgroup});await save();closeModal();render();toast('Ejercicio guardado en la biblioteca.');if(libraryTarget&&confirm('¿Quieres añadir este ejercicio a la rutina o sesión seleccionada?'))libConfigureAndAdd(e);return}if(f.id==='lib-group-form'){ev.preventDefault();ev.stopImmediatePropagation();const d=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f)),group=d.group.trim(),subgroup=d.subgroup.trim();if(!group)return toast('Escribe un grupo muscular.');if(!state.libraryGroups.some(g=>normText(g.name)===normText(group)&&normText(g.subgroup)===normText(subgroup)))state.libraryGroups.push({name:group,subgroup});await save();closeModal();render();toast('Grupo/subgrupo guardado.');return}},true);
// Add a library link to the existing routine screen without replacing its current tools.
const oldRoutinesView=routinesView;routinesView=function(){return oldRoutinesView()+`<div class="card" style="margin-top:18px"><h3>Catálogo de ejercicios</h3><p class="muted small">Biblioteca central con ${state.library?.length||0} ejercicios, filtros musculares, favoritos y ejercicios personalizados.</p><div class="actions"><button class="btn primary" data-view="biblioteca">Abrir biblioteca</button><button class="btn" data-action="lib-restore">Restaurar catálogo predeterminado</button></div></div>`};
document.addEventListener('click',ev=>{const b=ev.target.closest('[data-action="lib-restore"]');if(b){ev.preventDefault();ev.stopImmediatePropagation();libRestore()}},true);
